{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56502","headline":"还丹口诀 · 岑真人","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生太素，地产灵津。\n能伏能飞，变化如神。\n阴阳宗祖，道契君臣。\n圣人秘宝，非者不闻。\n且太素爲君，灵津爲臣。\n合和两性，呼吸相呑。\n爲夫爲妇，男女姻亲。\n变化钩牵，恩爱传真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}